WEBVTT

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:03.280
Dios mio, so exciting!

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:06.040
Kasahara is amazing us with her skills!

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:08.220
Incredible!

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:11.740
Appearing out of nowhere half a year ago 
and taking several competitions by storm,

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:12.900
she became climbing's new star!

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:17.530
Her analytic skills, which help her one-shot 
routes like she climbed 'em for years,

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:21.180
are being called "Murder Observation"! 
Mamma mia, how marvelous!

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:23.660
Way to go, Konomin. She's looking good.

00:00:24.610 --> 00:00:27.850
"Murder," though? That's not very nice.

00:00:27.850 --> 00:00:30.650
It fits though, when you 
see her in the zone.

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:33.770
Next up, the crux. The last hold.

00:00:33.770 --> 00:00:35.900
I need to wedge my fingers 
in at the very top.

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:37.930
Wedge my fingers in at 
the top of the sloper...

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:39.690
Top of the sloper...

00:00:39.690 --> 00:00:40.920
or I can't secure it...

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:42.310
Wedge my fingers in...

00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:44.280
or I can't secure it.

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:49.020
She flashes it! Excellent!

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.070
<i>Yes!</i>

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:57.030
<i>Kasahara Konomi, barrilete cósmico! 
Fantastic Murder Observation!</i>

00:01:14.510 --> 00:01:19.680
<b><i>Iwakakeru!</i></b>

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:32.250
<b><i> Wall 9                           The Princess of Climbing</i></b>

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:30.400
Congrats on your victory, Konomin!

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:32.250
Thank you!

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:36.430
Entering all those competitions over 
the past six months has really helped.

00:02:36.430 --> 00:02:40.330
You've built up more stamina and gotten 
used to the competitive atmosphere.

00:02:40.330 --> 00:02:41.500
Yeah, yeah!

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:43.840
You're attracting more 
attention from the guys, too.

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:46.020
Is that why you're wearing 
an extra hairpin now?

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:47.930
Huh? What?

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:49.520
N-No!

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:51.240
Really?

00:02:51.240 --> 00:02:52.270
Really!

00:02:52.270 --> 00:02:56.350
It's a symbol of my desire for Hanamiya 
to win the Combined Japan High School Cup!

00:02:56.350 --> 00:02:57.780
B-Back up...

00:02:57.780 --> 00:03:02.970
To win as a team! To win!

00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:01.360
You can definitely feel her enthusiasm.

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:02.420
Yeah...

00:03:03.430 --> 00:03:04.220
What's up?

00:03:04.220 --> 00:03:06.060
Is she here now?

00:03:06.060 --> 00:03:07.790
Who's here?

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:11.790
Cool Kurusu! Thanks for 
being here to welcome me!

00:03:12.220 --> 00:03:16.320
Anne-chan! Cool Kurusu!

00:03:16.320 --> 00:03:17.240
What?

00:03:17.240 --> 00:03:18.800
Kurusu Anne-san?

00:03:19.290 --> 00:03:22.600
Everyone... Cool Kurusu!

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:24.550
Cool Kurusu!

00:03:25.170 --> 00:03:26.650
Whoa.

00:03:26.650 --> 00:03:30.840
Didn't you know? She's scheduled to perform 
an exhibition climb here in a bit.

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:32.560
Seriously? Let's go watch!

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:36.910
Thanks for greeting me, 
everyone! Cool Kurusu!

00:03:36.910 --> 00:03:39.820
Not at all! Cool Kurusu!

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:42.330
A Cool Kurusu to you all!

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:47.580
Hey, it's Yotsuba Sayo-chan!

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:50.480
Huh? Do you know her?!

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:51.360
I don't.

00:03:51.360 --> 00:03:53.330
Uh, she's coming this way.

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:55.830
Long time, no see.

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:59.500
I haven't seen you since that 
last competition, Yotsuba-chan.

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:00.210
Yes.

00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:07.350
I'm honored that someone who competes with 
climbers all over the world remembers me.

00:04:07.710 --> 00:04:09.850
Why wouldn't I, Cool Kurusu?

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:15.350
You, Iwamine-chan, and Fujita-chan are 
famous as the Three Climbing Dames.

00:04:15.790 --> 00:04:17.160
Oh, what's this?

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:20.200
Aren't you Kasahara Konomi-chan? 
I didn't know you were here, too!

00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:22.740
What? You know of me?

00:04:23.130 --> 00:04:27.960
Of course I do. Kasahara Konomi-chan, 
with the Murder Observation.

00:04:27.960 --> 00:04:32.120
Everyone in climbing is talking 
about you now, Cool Kurusu!

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:34.370
Oh, you flatter me!

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:36.500
I've been wanting to meet you.

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:43.950
Say, Konomi-chan, do you 
mind being friends with me?

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:46.270
Huh? Uh, I'd love to.

00:04:46.270 --> 00:04:48.430
Yay! That's so cool, Kurusu!

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:50.430
Oh, right.

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:53.930
Guys, I have an announcement!

00:04:53.930 --> 00:04:55.100
What's this?

00:04:53.930 --> 00:04:55.510
Are they doing something together?

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:56.940
Are Anne-chan and Kasahara Konomi
 up to something?

00:04:55.510 --> 00:04:56.940
What is it? What is it?

00:04:57.280 --> 00:05:02.650
I want to hold an exhibition match, 
Anne vs. Kasahara Konomi.

00:05:03.510 --> 00:05:07.280
Me climbing by myself would just be boring.

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:08.200
Wai...

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:11.180
Gotta live up to expectations, right?

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:14.750
A duel?

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:17.960
It's a discipline you sometimes 
see in competition finals.

00:05:18.370 --> 00:05:22.080
Climbers get one minute to observe, then 
attempt the same problem simultaneously.

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:23.710
Whoever finishes first wins.

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:28.590
It's basically like the halfway 
point between speed and bouldering.

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:32.160
Anyway, it's just something 
Anne-chan came up with on a whim,

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:34.190
so you could just turn it down.

00:05:34.190 --> 00:05:36.390
I personally don't see a need to refuse.

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:38.350
Of course I'll do it.

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:40.860
Gotta live up to expectations.

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:42.730
"Expectations"?

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:45.000
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:48.380
The exhibition match of a 
lifetime is about to begin!

00:05:48.380 --> 00:05:49.470
The rules are simple.

00:05:49.470 --> 00:05:52.740
Whoever presses their button 
atop the wall first wins!

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:58.480
First, we have today's champion, Kasahara
 Konomi, with her Murder Observation!

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:03.500
Her opponent: ruler of the girls' 
climbing world, the Princess of Climbing,

00:06:03.820 --> 00:06:05.320
Kurusu Anne!

00:06:05.320 --> 00:06:07.210
Cool Kurusu!

00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:09.080
Anne-chan!

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:11.750
Okay, start the observation process!

00:06:15.010 --> 00:06:16.490
<i>A wall with an overhang...</i>

00:06:16.490 --> 00:06:18.310
<i>Not many moves to make. Maybe five or six.</i>

00:06:18.820 --> 00:06:21.630
<i>Most of the moves involve 
pushing, not pulling,</i>

00:06:21.630 --> 00:06:24.300
<i>including the crux at the end
 which requires a mantel.</i>

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:27.310
<i>But I can't gauge the distance 
to the top from here.</i>

00:06:27.310 --> 00:06:29.200
Observation time's up!

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:30.570
What? Already?

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:31.820
I'm not done yet.

00:06:32.170 --> 00:06:34.830
Let's start the exhibition match!

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:38.730
Three, two, one... Go!

00:06:35.300 --> 00:06:38.090
I'll push down on the hold 
with my wrist and reach out.

00:06:42.640 --> 00:06:45.520
<i>Okay, so far, so good.</i>

00:06:45.520 --> 00:06:47.720
<i>Now to mantel the crux.</i>

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:54.040
<i>S-So far!</i>

00:06:55.320 --> 00:06:56.600
<i>Get it!</i>

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:58.590
<i>Almost there!</i>

00:06:58.590 --> 00:07:00.600
You're almost there.

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:06.360
You can do this, Konomi-chan! Hang in there!

00:07:07.090 --> 00:07:09.140
Come on! Come on!

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:14.060
I was no match for her.

00:07:14.060 --> 00:07:15.620
Konomi-chan.

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:19.740
Thanks for accepting this sudden match up.

00:07:19.740 --> 00:07:21.620
I had lots of fun!

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:29.530
Guys, give Konomi-chan a big Cool Kurusu!

00:07:29.530 --> 00:07:32.400
Konomi-chan! Cool Kurusu!

00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:33.590
Konomi-chan.

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:36.390
Let's climb together again sometime.

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:38.490
Sure.

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:42.900
<i>I've got so much to learn.</i>

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:45.640
<i>I climb so slowly, too.</i>

00:07:45.640 --> 00:07:49.790
Cool Kurusu! Your heart's 
going on a cool Kuruise!

00:07:49.790 --> 00:07:50.780
Anne-san?

00:07:51.210 --> 00:07:56.030
Wow, do you always post-climb 
analyze by yourself?

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:57.500
Oh, I guess.

00:07:57.500 --> 00:07:58.970
So admirable!

00:07:58.970 --> 00:08:00.290
N-Not really.

00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:05.280
I realized I have so far 
to go after that match up.

00:08:05.280 --> 00:08:08.420
You do? I don't think so!

00:08:08.680 --> 00:08:09.980
I do.

00:08:09.980 --> 00:08:13.950
But, one day, I want to be able to win those.

00:08:13.950 --> 00:08:17.430
Not just for myself, but for Hanamiya, too.

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:22.970
And I want us to win the Combined Japan 
High School Cup in two months' time!

00:08:22.970 --> 00:08:25.310
Huh... You want Hanamiya to win?

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:28.080
Yes! It's our dream!

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:30.820
Nyuk, nyuk, Cool Nyuks.

00:08:31.120 --> 00:08:33.570
That is just not gonna happen.

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:38.940
Look at you, letting a teensy-weensy 
bit of attention get to your head.

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:43.770
"Murder Observation"? 
"The Three Climbing Dames"?

00:08:43.770 --> 00:08:46.720
It makes me laugh. Nyuk, nyuk, nyuk.

00:08:46.720 --> 00:08:50.010
Allow me to enlighten you. 
You girls have no chance in hell,

00:08:50.010 --> 00:08:53.090
because yours truly is gonna 
enter that competition.

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:58.410
Sucks to be you. You can't beat
 Kokureikan High with me, a pro, leading it.

00:08:58.410 --> 00:09:02.590
With Hanamiya, of all schools? 
Do you even have any decent climbers?

00:09:02.590 --> 00:09:05.280
In the Kanto championships, 
one was knocked out in the prelims.

00:09:05.280 --> 00:09:08.620
One in the semis. 
One withdrew from the finals.

00:09:08.620 --> 00:09:10.260
And then, you...

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:13.640
What do you think you girls can even do?

00:09:13.640 --> 00:09:14.990
Come to think of it,

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:18.320
I haven't seen one of you in a while. 
Did she give it up?

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:21.330
Smart choice. Not like she had 
any talent for this, anyway.

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:25.320
Your little "dream" will remain just that!

00:09:25.320 --> 00:09:28.210
Why... Why would you say 
such hurtful things?!

00:09:28.620 --> 00:09:30.300
Why, you ask?

00:09:36.400 --> 00:09:38.250
Because the truth hurts.

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:43.980
I'm going to beat you and win 
the Combined Japan High School Cup!

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:45.540
You what?

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:51.900
Cool Kurusu would love to see you try.

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:54.860
Welcome back.

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:58.360
How'd the exhibition climb go?

00:09:58.360 --> 00:10:02.740
I wasn't the least bit excited about 
entering a high school competition,

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:05.280
but now I'm looking forward to it a little.

00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:09.670
You and Anne-chan talked in the showers?

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:11.100
Y-Yeah.

00:10:11.100 --> 00:10:13.420
She's entering, is she?

00:10:13.420 --> 00:10:14.300
Yeah.

00:10:14.620 --> 00:10:17.990
As if Kokureikan wasn't a 
powerhouse without her, too.

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:21.120
Oh, they aren't the only 
powerhouses we're up against.

00:10:22.550 --> 00:10:27.210
You learned something important
 in that exhibition match, didn't you?

00:10:27.210 --> 00:10:28.060
I did.

00:10:28.430 --> 00:10:30.410
I'm not fast enough.

00:10:30.410 --> 00:10:31.060
Correct.

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:37.940
<b>Example
Speed    35th
Bouldering    2nd
Lead   3rd</b>

00:10:31.370 --> 00:10:35.320
When you compete in all three disciplines, 
your rankings in each are multiplied

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:37.940
and the lower your score, the better it is.

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:42.950
So, it'll be hard to place if 
you do badly in any discipline.

00:10:43.230 --> 00:10:49.330
If we're aiming for victory as a team, 
we need to train with a focus on speed.

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:52.000
We need a speed climbing coach.

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:53.160
We already have one.

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:57.210
Hanamiya's very own trusty speedster.

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:18.240
Welcome.

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:22.240
<b>Receptionist</b>

00:11:19.560 --> 00:11:21.700
Take care and have fun.

00:11:22.850 --> 00:11:24.220
<i>Ugh.</i>

00:11:24.220 --> 00:11:27.310
<i>It's great that I get to 
use this gym for free,</i>

00:11:27.310 --> 00:11:29.740
<i>but I really am allergic to this stuff.</i>

00:11:30.690 --> 00:11:32.420
This is so hilarious.

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:36.290
Uehara Jun is <i>smiling</i>?

00:11:36.760 --> 00:11:39.550
Why'd the new hire have 
to be you, of all people?

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:42.170
Right back at you.

00:11:42.170 --> 00:11:45.120
I wasn't expecting to see you working here...

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:46.300
Li'l Miss Loser.

00:11:46.610 --> 00:11:47.560
What.

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:51.290
Mew sure embarrassed yourself 
in that last bouldering competition.

00:11:51.290 --> 00:11:55.340
Well, if I'm a loser, what does that make you? 
You crashed out in the prelims.

00:11:55.340 --> 00:11:56.190
'scuse me?

00:11:56.490 --> 00:11:58.440
You picking a catfight?

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:00.690
You started it.

00:12:03.430 --> 00:12:04.860
Uehara-sensei!

00:12:04.860 --> 00:12:06.730
When are we starting bouldering class?

00:12:06.730 --> 00:12:08.400
We're all here.

00:12:08.400 --> 00:12:11.610
Oh, sorry. I'll be right there,
 so wait by the wall.

00:12:11.610 --> 00:12:12.990
Gotcha.

00:12:12.990 --> 00:12:14.210
Let's go.

00:12:18.740 --> 00:12:22.460
A sourpuss like you, 
teaching a bouldering class for kids?

00:12:22.460 --> 00:12:24.090
Shut up! Not one more word!

00:12:24.630 --> 00:12:27.400
Well, since you have seniority 
here at work and all,

00:12:27.400 --> 00:12:30.720
I'll come and watch for refurrence, okay?

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:32.160
Uehara-sensei?

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:34.310
Tch. Do what you want.

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:41.000
Today, I'll be teaching you 
how to identify problems.

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:42.490
Bouldering!

00:12:42.980 --> 00:12:45.510
<i>Urk, they're so hyper.</i>

00:12:45.510 --> 00:12:48.030
Climbing gyms have a litany of holds,

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:51.620
and their color represents which problem 
they belong to and how difficult it is.

00:12:52.030 --> 00:12:54.870
A set course mapped on a 
wall is called a "route."

00:12:55.320 --> 00:13:00.380
Its start is marked by an "S" sticker 
and its goal with a "G."

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:04.490
I don't get it!

00:13:04.490 --> 00:13:07.400
You keep using big words, 
Uehara-sensei!

00:13:07.400 --> 00:13:09.310
S-Sorry.

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:11.930
<i>I thought I was keeping it simple...</i>

00:13:13.750 --> 00:13:16.000
They're really hating on you, Uehara-sensei.

00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:16.900
Not the time for jokes!

00:13:17.260 --> 00:13:18.750
Well, just watch me.

00:13:18.750 --> 00:13:22.550
If you can manage to get 
your claws into them, you win.

00:13:24.160 --> 00:13:26.280
Hear me, my little kittens.

00:13:26.720 --> 00:13:28.910
You know what bouldering is all about?

00:13:29.430 --> 00:13:33.660
It's a game where mew have to 
collect gems of the same color!

00:13:35.900 --> 00:13:38.120
Collect gems! Game!

00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:39.160
Mew!

00:13:39.160 --> 00:13:40.420
The mew, too?!

00:13:40.760 --> 00:13:44.080
You collect gems of the same 
color as the starting gem

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:46.800
and if you reach the goal gem, mew win!

00:13:47.130 --> 00:13:49.050
Reach the goal gem, mew win!

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:55.060
<b>Climbing 
Grades</b>

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:55.060
<b>V0-V1</b>

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:55.060
<b>V2</b>

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:55.060
<b>V3</b>

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:55.060
<b>V4</b>

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:55.060
<b>V5</b>

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:55.060
<b>V6</b>

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:55.060
<b>V7</b>

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:55.060
<b>V8</b>

00:13:49.340 --> 00:13:52.220
This chart has the value of each kind of gem.

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:55.060
Go out there and collect all the gems meow!

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:57.560
Yeah! We'll do it meow!

00:13:58.030 --> 00:13:59.390
<i>Wow.</i>

00:13:59.390 --> 00:14:03.940
<i>Why is she so good at teaching when she's 
called the Rookie Killer and stuff?</i>

00:14:04.270 --> 00:14:07.840
Okay. I'll show you the basics 
of collecting the gems,

00:14:07.840 --> 00:14:10.260
so tell me which color you all want.

00:14:10.260 --> 00:14:11.530
Red, red!

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:12.780
Green!

00:14:11.970 --> 00:14:13.740
Blue!

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:16.520
Aw, listen to all these requests.

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:19.850
Akane-sensei is way too pawpular!

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:21.840
You, the girl there.

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:23.600
What's your request?

00:14:23.600 --> 00:14:25.090
Um, then...

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:27.800
Those purple gems!

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:29.640
Okay, okay. Purrple, eh?

00:14:29.640 --> 00:14:30.220
Ack.

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:33.130
<i>Dug your own grave.</i>

00:14:33.130 --> 00:14:36.440
<i>The purple problem is the most 
difficult one this gym has.</i>

00:14:36.440 --> 00:14:37.230
<i>Can you climb it?</i>

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:41.640
Uh, then, we shall now 
collect these purple gems.

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:45.230
Uehara-sensei will collect them for mew!

00:14:45.230 --> 00:14:47.740
H-Hey, who said you could...

00:14:48.060 --> 00:14:50.780
Isn't this your class?

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:52.200
Just look.

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:55.240
Get a load of their hopeful gazes.

00:14:55.600 --> 00:14:57.240
They're waiting on you.

00:14:57.240 --> 00:14:58.700
It's time to prowl.

00:15:01.760 --> 00:15:05.840
Okay, watch Uehara-sensei 
climb the purple route meow!

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:07.050
Meow!

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:10.380
First, you place your hands and feet
 on the initial purple gems,

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:11.640
and then...

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:21.980
What are you doing? Get climbing.

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:25.270
Are you mad I'm making
 you go up the tree?

00:15:25.270 --> 00:15:29.280
What's the big deal? 
This problem should be easy for...

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:33.280
Wait, what?

00:15:33.600 --> 00:15:36.920
Don't tell me... you can't climb?

00:15:39.190 --> 00:15:40.720
Hey!

00:15:40.720 --> 00:15:42.470
Uehara-sensei?

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:48.360
I'm so sorry.

00:15:48.360 --> 00:15:49.510
Jun-chan.

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:53.050
Konomi.

00:15:59.150 --> 00:16:01.070
What is her problem?

00:16:01.070 --> 00:16:04.900
She ran off and left me
 to deal with all those kittens!

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:09.400
Kasahara Konomi?

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:12.200
Wait, why am I even hiding?

00:16:12.640 --> 00:16:14.720
You're working here, huh?

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:15.690
Yeah.

00:16:15.690 --> 00:16:18.620
<i>Wrong! That's not what I want to ask her!</i>

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:20.960
Uh, the other day in school...

00:16:20.960 --> 00:16:22.120
It's fine.

00:16:22.520 --> 00:16:26.080
<i>I'm doing it again. 
That's not what I want to say.</i>

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:31.280
I need to go.

00:16:31.280 --> 00:16:32.340
Oh, wait!

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:33.160
What?

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:35.980
I need you to teach me something.

00:16:37.330 --> 00:16:38.240
Uh...

00:16:38.240 --> 00:16:40.420
Sorry, but leave.

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:47.200
Again, why am I skulking around?

00:16:47.200 --> 00:16:48.230
Jun-chan,

00:16:48.510 --> 00:16:50.340
sorry for showing up out of the blue.

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:05.270
Uehara Jun.

00:17:06.110 --> 00:17:06.960
What?

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:08.960
You're gonna compete with me.

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:10.210
Huh?

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:14.720
Let's see who can climb 
that purple problem better.

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:17.970
If I win, you'll quit this job.

00:17:17.970 --> 00:17:21.530
Wha... I can't do that!

00:17:21.530 --> 00:17:25.740
You got hired because we're short on staff.

00:17:25.740 --> 00:17:27.960
Besides, I...

00:17:27.960 --> 00:17:30.730
You're too afuraid of walls to climb?

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:37.160
You look like you're about to crumble 
into kibble, so I'll help you along.

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:39.990
Uchimura Akane, the Rookie Killer, 
will finish you off.

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:42.540
Not that mew're a rookie.

00:17:43.240 --> 00:17:46.640
Well, you don't have to accept
 if you're a fraidy cat.

00:17:46.640 --> 00:17:49.500
I'll just write it off as Uehara Jun
 being finished as a climber...

00:17:49.790 --> 00:17:52.490
Along with the Hanamiya team.

00:17:52.490 --> 00:17:53.760
<i>Hanamiya?</i>

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:57.280
I heard Yotsuba-san was injured,

00:17:57.280 --> 00:17:59.440
and with you looking like 
something the cat dragged in...

00:17:59.440 --> 00:18:02.520
Maybe Hanamiya's already done for.

00:18:02.520 --> 00:18:03.640
What a catastrophe.

00:18:11.840 --> 00:18:13.580
I accept your challenge.

00:18:13.580 --> 00:18:17.780
I'll win and prove what Hanamiya's made of!

00:18:20.230 --> 00:18:23.540
Big words from the little kitty 
who couldn't complete one move.

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:34.250
Wow, Uchimura-sensei!

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:35.540
You almost had it!

00:18:34.600 --> 00:18:36.860
You were almost at the goal!

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:38.300
So close!

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:39.020
Amazing!

00:18:39.020 --> 00:18:42.050
<i>I couldn't send it, 
but I did hit a personal best.</i>

00:18:43.110 --> 00:18:46.240
Now it's Uehara-sensei's turn.

00:18:46.240 --> 00:18:48.560
Do your best, Sensei!

00:18:48.560 --> 00:18:50.560
Hope you're a lucky cat.

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:53.210
No worries. I'll win.

00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:10.160
<i>My hand... my body's still trembling.</i>

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:11.500
<i>I'm competing here!</i>

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:12.620
Go!

00:19:12.620 --> 00:19:14.500
Go, Uehara-sensei!

00:19:14.500 --> 00:19:15.620
Sensei!

00:19:14.780 --> 00:19:17.260
<i>If nothing changes, victory is mine.</i>

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:21.260
<i>Please... Please, my right hand, go up!</i>

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:24.100
<i>I'll finally beat the Uehara Jun!</i>

00:19:26.510 --> 00:19:27.690
<i>I'll finally...</i>

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:30.100
Go, Uehara-sensei!

00:19:32.030 --> 00:19:33.230
<i>...beat the...</i>

00:19:33.750 --> 00:19:35.360
<i>Please move.</i>

00:19:35.890 --> 00:19:36.980
<i>The...</i>

00:19:37.310 --> 00:19:38.360
Go up!

00:19:38.670 --> 00:19:39.740
<i>The...</i>

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:41.320
<i>Why won't you move?</i>

00:19:41.690 --> 00:19:43.070
What is wrong with mew?!

00:19:44.440 --> 00:19:46.450
<i>The</i> Uehara Jun, my butthole!

00:19:46.880 --> 00:19:48.620
You think this is a joke?!

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:54.600
<i>I'm Uchimura Akane, the Rookie Killer 
who'll happily do whatever it takes.</i>

00:19:54.600 --> 00:19:57.930
<i>Ending Uehara Jun for good would make me 
the cat who swallowed the canary!</i>

00:19:57.930 --> 00:19:58.920
<i>But...</i>

00:19:59.650 --> 00:20:01.380
Quit messing around!

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:04.360
Is that how my generation's star climbs?

00:20:04.360 --> 00:20:08.260
Mew climb nothing like 
the girl I know and hate!

00:20:08.620 --> 00:20:13.390
If you're... If you're really Uehara Jun,

00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:18.270
hurry up and reach the ceiling,
 then look down on me from up there!

00:20:23.560 --> 00:20:29.160
<i>I was a perfectly ordinary little girl. 
No likes, no goals, no individuality.</i>

00:20:29.780 --> 00:20:33.250
<i>Then I happened to 
come across these walls</i>

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:36.500
<i>and before long, I was obsessed 
with the sport of climbing.</i>

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:38.170
<i>I...</i>

00:20:40.050 --> 00:20:41.240
Sensei!

00:20:41.240 --> 00:20:42.840
You can do it!

00:20:42.670 --> 00:20:43.550
Go!

00:20:43.550 --> 00:20:44.840
Sensei!

00:20:45.590 --> 00:20:46.800
Whoa!

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:49.880
She got the second gem!

00:20:49.880 --> 00:20:51.660
So cool, Sensei!

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:57.770
<i>I...</i>

00:20:58.360 --> 00:21:00.630
<i>In the limited time I had at the gym,</i>

00:21:00.630 --> 00:21:04.090
<i>I tried and tried to take in the view 
from the top as many times as I could.</i>

00:21:04.090 --> 00:21:07.870
<i>Faster, even faster, over and over again.</i>

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:13.200
<i>During that process, I became more 
and more hooked on climbing.</i>

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:17.380
<i>At the same time, I started 
developing tunnel vision.</i>

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:21.160
<i>When I saw people not climbing well,</i>

00:21:21.160 --> 00:21:25.130
<i>I'd think, "You can't do this. 
Go away and let me climb."</i>

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:28.090
<i>I couldn't stand people who climbed for fun.</i>

00:21:28.090 --> 00:21:31.880
<i>At some point, I completely forgot.</i>

00:21:31.880 --> 00:21:33.180
<i>Even I...</i>

00:21:38.200 --> 00:21:41.020
<i>Even I only started doing 
this because I found it fun!</i>

00:21:43.360 --> 00:21:44.400
<i>And...</i>

00:21:45.010 --> 00:21:46.400
<i>And...</i>

00:21:49.910 --> 00:21:53.030
<i>I loved this view from the top!</i>

00:21:52.100 --> 00:21:54.860
Wow! You did it!

00:21:59.680 --> 00:22:04.500
<i>Th-That's the Uehara Jun I know! 
And, one day, I'll destroy her!</i>

00:23:35.050 --> 00:23:40.060
<b><i>Iwakakeru!</i></b>

00:23:35.050 --> 00:23:40.060
<b><i>Wall 10: Restart!</i></b>
